cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and its frozen pilot protocol when using the code or captured evidence."
type: software
title: "Experience Forge: observable external-memory reuse under calibration outage"
authors:
  - name: "Experience Forge contributors"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A local research prototype comparing no memory, unvalidated model-generated memory
  and validated model-generated memory after conversation reset. One authored
  affine connector task family, one local tool agent, independent qualification,
  evidence-bound writes, frozen captured pilot and model-free replay. External
  information reuse is measured separately from verified task completion.
